    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36843" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑξᾰπέλεκῠς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
